window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Between saving humanity, a childhood friend or your true love, who would you choose?</p> <p>In a world where Science is the law and you must adhere strictly to scientific principles, I chose to go the opposite way and rely on the Universe for answers that Science cannot explain. Secretly, I cling onto the spiritual beliefs that my mother left for me.</p> <p>With the help of a scientist, a doctor, a soldier and a rich mechanic, I’ve found a revolting truth in the leadership of society and there are reeks of ominous layers within it. My instinct tells me there are greater dangers beyond the walls, if we're keeping in Science then what are we keeping out? The Island has already been eradicated. Echo seems to be after a cure so we believe a virus is out there. In order to save the last of mankind, I need to shut out my emotions but I guess the Universe had other plans for me ; that is until I met a mysterious man that changed everything I know.</p> <p>How will I let people know what Echo Nova is doing? Worse yet, how will I ever teach them a piece of my spiritual knowledge and wisdom- where all they know is Science.</p> <p>My name is Zaya Sky Silverton. If you can hear this message, we need your help. Plea-Com- ...[beep... beep... beep...]</p> <p><b>PLEASE NOTE: When you purchase this title, the accompanying PDF will be available in your Audible Library along with the audio.</b></p>"; 
